{"title":"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An urn contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> green balls and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> blue balls. A second urn contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> green balls and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> blue balls. A single ball is drawn at random from each urn. The probability that both balls are of the same color is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4bc9194438881cb5c388a0a812ffa6f4d101e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.58$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we find the probability both are green, then the probability both are blue, and add the two probabilities. The sum should be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4bc9194438881cb5c388a0a812ffa6f4d101e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.58$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p><p>The probability both are green is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5dbb5a57e3d52c75386f26e322f033b2e5c4bdb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{10}\\cdot\\frac{16}{16+N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"94\" height=\"39\" />, and the probability both are blue is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d30d8a9485c9af95e98593363476f23e430d37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{10}\\cdot\\frac{N}{16+N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"94\" height=\"39\" />, so \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/8/3f803fe9c2a3ba3f05533a2c351610dda78c116c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{4}{10}\\cdot\\frac{16}{16+N}+\\frac{6}{10}\\cdot\\frac{N}{16+N}=\\frac{29}{50}\\]\" width=\"257\" height=\"38\" />\nSolving this equation, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/0/5c0c506554a3219b40d67f33153c47b2c5ac6836.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[20\\left(\\frac{16}{16+N}\\right)+30\\left(\\frac{N}{16+N}\\right)=29\\]\" width=\"280\" height=\"43\" />\nMultiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b02b3c3a909153a30002e62725bf23195d24f167.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16+N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" />, we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fcb1e38d5c58977cb3da11b480f5bb04c3e5e26.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 20\\cdot16+30\\cdot N&amp;=29(16+N)\\\\ 320+30N&amp;=464+29N\\\\ N&amp;=\\boxed{144} \\end{align*}\" width=\"231\" height=\"74\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I\" title=\"2014 AIME I\">2014 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2014\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2014 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\